  "text_to_speech_word_count": 231,
  "timecoded_text_to_speech": [
    {
      "end": "00:00:18.000",
      "start": "00:00:00.000",
      "text": " We have prepared for war, and now war is here."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:36.000",
      "start": "00:00:31.000",
      "text": " We were established as one nation under God."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:38.000",
      "start": "00:00:36.000",
      "text": " Beers at our back."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:43.000",
      "start": "00:00:40.000",
      "text": " I hereby renounce the institution of slavery,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:46.000",
      "start": "00:00:43.000",
      "text": " and direct my family that all our slaves be immediately and eternal."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:47.000",
      "start": "00:00:46.000",
      "text": " Set free."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:48.000",
      "start": "00:00:47.000",
      "text": " Yes!"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:49.000",
      "start": "00:00:48.000",
      "text": " We go to them!"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:50.000",
      "start": "00:00:49.000",
      "text": " And them!"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:55.000",
      "start": "00:00:53.000",
      "text": " This will destroy our family."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:56.000",
      "start": "00:00:55.000",
      "text": " Our neighbors will count us together."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:57.000",
      "start": "00:00:56.000",
      "text": " They are the neighbors,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:59.000",
      "start": "00:00:57.000",
      "text": " and they will buy our own will."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:02.000",
      "start": "00:00:59.000",
      "text": " But at the slags, we will lose point of honor and everything else we know."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:08.000",
      "start": "00:01:04.000",
      "text": " How can you renounce slavery and then join the side fighting to defend it?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:10.000",
      "start": "00:01:09.000",
      "text": " You're married to my system."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:12.000",
      "start": "00:01:10.000",
      "text": " This means my family is yours too."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:14.000",
      "start": "00:01:12.000",
      "text": " If you come in peace, it will be your home."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:18.000",
      "start": "00:01:14.000",
      "text": " If you come in war, then you and I will fight."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:22.000",
      "start": "00:01:20.000",
      "text": " Get away from my poor child while you're goddamn dead."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:26.000",
      "start": "00:01:22.000",
      "text": " Your family is choosing to sympathize with our enemies."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:32.000",
      "start": "00:01:27.000",
      "text": " From this moment forward, every decision you make will forever affect your lives."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:38.000",
      "start": "00:01:36.000",
      "text": " Mr. Cutler say you go sell my sister to Swan plantation."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:39.000",
      "start": "00:01:38.000",
      "text": " Phoebe has been sold."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:41.000",
      "start": "00:01:39.000",
      "text": " You can't sell me, you can't!"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:49.000",
      "start": "00:01:48.000",
      "text": " He's the end, kid."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:54.000",
      "start": "00:01:49.000",
      "text": " My husband, don't you ever let our father know that you chose anything but this family."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:57.000",
      "start": "00:01:54.000",
      "text": " Where you have lived and died has not been your choice."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:00.000",
      "start": "00:01:57.000",
      "text": " Until today, you are all free."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:02.000",
      "start": "00:02:00.000",
      "text": " Sir, what are we going to now?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:08.000",
      "start": "00:02:05.000",
      "text": " Now that Heaven or Hell could stop me, I will marry you."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:13.000",
      "start": "00:02:12.000",
      "text": " This is our nation."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:15.000",
      "start": "00:02:13.000",
      "text": " We will restore her."
